   "text": "What about nature documentaries? She might",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.73,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "actually like those more.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.76,
   "block": "movies.dlg1",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Great idea. Ocean and jungle series are gorgeous and full of amazing facts. Just skip the predator scenes if she's sensitive.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
